# This is the project's tech stack

- Svelte, Typescript and tailwindCSS for building frontend components.
- Vanilla css, DOM manipulation methods where needed.
- Tauri crossplatform framework for desktop and mobile builds.
- SQLite for embedded database.
- Iroh for enabling peer-to-peer connectivity.
- prosemirror for text editor.
- Common directory is used for common components, frontends divided into mobile desktop for password manager and we are currenty focusing on live collaborative text editor called livnote. 


